    "description": "Government to reduce taxes further, says President",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Government-to-reduce-taxes-further-says-President/108-353861",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
